<section class="card feature-card"><span class="plan-kicker">OFFICIAL VISION</span><h2 data-en="Digitizing East Africa’s Freight Backbone — Connecting Cargo, Eliminating Empty Backhaul Trips, and Modernizing Regional Logistics." data-sw="Kuweka kidijitali uti wa mgongo wa usafirishaji wa mizigo Afrika Mashariki — Kuunganisha mizigo, kuondoa safari za kurudi bila mzigo, na kufanya usafirishaji wa kikanda kuwa wa kisasa.">Digitizing East Africa’s Freight Backbone — Connecting Cargo, Eliminating Empty Backhaul Trips, and Modernizing Regional Logistics.</h2><h3>Mission</h3><p data-en="To connect cargo with verified transport capacity through digital freight workflows that reduce empty backhaul trips, improve shipment visibility and enable efficient, reliable logistics for shippers and transporters across Tanzania and East Africa." data-sw="Kuunganisha mizigo na uwezo wa usafiri uliothibitishwa kupitia mifumo ya kidijitali inayopunguza safari za kurudi bila mzigo, kuboresha uonekano wa shehena na kuwezesha usafirishaji wenye ufanisi na kutegemewa kwa wasafirishaji na wamiliki wa vyombo vya usafiri Tanzania na Afrika Mashariki.">To connect cargo with verified transport capacity through digital freight workflows that reduce empty backhaul trips, improve shipment visibility and enable efficient, reliable logistics for shippers and transporters across Tanzania and East Africa.</p></section>
<div class="grid" style="margin-top:18px"><section class="card"><h2 data-en="About McCollins" data-sw="Kuhusu McCollins">About McCollins</h2><p data-en="McCollin Company (Int'l) Limited is developing an enterprise technology platform to address fragmentation and inefficiency in Tanzania’s commercial trucking sector. The platform connects maritime import logistics with domestic and regional agricultural supply chains, replacing opaque, paper-heavy coordination with accountable digital freight workflows." data-sw="McCollin Company (Int'l) Limited inaendeleza jukwaa la kiteknolojia la biashara kushughulikia mgawanyiko na ukosefu wa ufanisi katika sekta ya malori ya kibiashara Tanzania. Jukwaa linaunganisha usafirishaji wa mizigo ya baharini na minyororo ya ugavi ya kilimo ya ndani na kikanda kupitia mifumo ya kidijitali inayowajibika.">McCollin Company (Int'l) Limited is developing an enterprise technology platform to address fragmentation and inefficiency in Tanzania’s commercial trucking sector. The platform connects maritime import logistics with domestic and regional agricultural supply chains, replacing opaque, paper-heavy coordination with accountable digital freight workflows.</p></section><section class="card"><h2 data-en="The problem we address" data-sw="Tatizo tunaloshughulikia">The problem we address</h2><p data-en="Freight operations are affected by empty backhaul trips, unpredictable brokerage costs, limited cargo visibility and paper-heavy delivery processes that delay settlement. McCollins focuses on connecting available transport capacity with cargo across Tanzania and East African transit corridors." data-sw="Shughuli za usafirishaji huathiriwa na safari za kurudi bila mzigo, gharama zisizotabirika za udalali, uonekano mdogo wa mizigo na taratibu za karatasi zinazochelewesha malipo. McCollins inalenga kuunganisha uwezo wa usafiri uliopo na mizigo katika Tanzania na njia za usafiri za Afrika Mashariki.">Freight operations are affected by empty backhaul trips, unpredictable brokerage costs, limited cargo visibility and paper-heavy delivery processes that delay settlement. McCollins focuses on connecting available transport capacity with cargo across Tanzania and East African transit corridors.</p></section><section class="card"><h2 data-en="Technology approach" data-sw="Mbinu ya kiteknolojia">Technology approach</h2><p data-en="The implemented portal supports verified fleet matching, transport offers, assignment, dispatch, milestone tracking, exceptions, electronic proof of delivery and settlement workflows. Advanced AI optimization, live GPS telematics, dynamic spot bidding, mobile applications and bank/mobile-money APIs remain platform roadmap capabilities until their integrations are completed." data-sw="Jukwaa lililotekelezwa linaunga mkono ulinganishaji wa magari yaliyothibitishwa, ofa za usafiri, ugawaji, dispatch, ufuatiliaji wa hatua, matukio ya kipekee, uthibitisho wa kidijitali wa uwasilishaji na malipo. Uboreshaji wa AI, GPS ya moja kwa moja, zabuni za papo hapo, programu za simu na API za benki/pesa za simu bado ni uwezo wa baadaye hadi miunganisho ikamilike.">The implemented portal supports verified fleet matching, transport offers, assignment, dispatch, milestone tracking, exceptions, electronic proof of delivery and settlement workflows. Advanced AI optimization, live GPS telematics, dynamic spot bidding, mobile applications and bank/mobile-money APIs remain platform roadmap capabilities until their integrations are completed.</p></section></div>
<section class="card" style="margin-top:18px"><h2 data-en="Who we serve" data-sw="Tunaowahudumia">Who we serve</h2><div class="grid"><div><h3>Cargo Owners &amp; Shippers</h3><p data-en="Reliable verified capacity, transparent operational coordination and shipment visibility." data-sw="Uwezo wa usafiri uliothibitishwa, uratibu wa wazi na uonekano wa shehena.">Reliable verified capacity, transparent operational coordination and shipment visibility.</p></div><div><h3>Transporters &amp; Fleet Owners</h3><p data-en="Direct access to cargo opportunities, improved fleet utilization and reduced empty return trips." data-sw="Upatikanaji wa moja kwa moja wa fursa za mizigo, matumizi bora ya magari na kupunguza safari za kurudi bila mzigo.">Direct access to cargo opportunities, improved fleet utilization and reduced empty return trips.</p></div><div><h3>Clearing &amp; Forwarding Agents</h3><p data-en="Coordinated fleet booking, cargo progress visibility and streamlined documentation." data-sw="Uratibu wa magari, uonekano wa maendeleo ya mizigo na nyaraka zilizorahisishwa.">Coordinated fleet booking, cargo progress visibility and streamlined documentation.</p></div><div><h3>Truck Drivers &amp; Operators</h3><p data-en="Clear trip assignments, digital updates, e-POD support and visible settlement status." data-sw="Ugawaji wazi wa safari, taarifa za kidijitali, e-POD na uonekano wa hali ya malipo.">Clear trip assignments, digital updates, e-POD support and visible settlement status.</p></div></div></section>
